# Click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code REST Client extension).
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### All cakes on sale
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes

### Eggless cakes for Diwali
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes?occasion=diwali&tag=eggless

### One cake (ingredients, allergens, sizes)
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes/pistachio-rose

### Price for two 8-inch red velvet cakes
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes/red-velvet/quote?size=8in&qty=2

### Unavailable cake -> 409
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes/mango-seasonal/quote?size=6in

### Mixed case works (expect 200, 1 cake)
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes?occasion=Diwali

### Unknown parameter (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes?colour=red

### Bad occasion (expect 400 with a reason)
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes?occasion=new%20year

### Bad all value (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/v1/cakes?all=maybe